Sītā gathering flowers spots golden jeweled deer --- Sītā calls Rāma and Lakṣmaṇa to see marvel --- Lakṣmaṇa warns deer is Mārīca māyā trap --- Sītā demands living deer for palace wonder --- Sītā claims hide for grass seat if killed --- Rāma marvels and recalls Vātāpi slain by Agastya --- Rāma orders Lakṣmaṇa to guard Sītā with Jaṭāyu --- Rāma vows to kill or capture deer